cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SleepFM-Unify, please cite this software and the upstream SleepFM papers."
type: software
title: "SleepFM-Unify"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-14"
url: "https://github.com/Coucou2016/SleepFM-Unify"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Coucou2016/SleepFM-Unify"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "SleepFM-Unify contributors"
abstract: >-
  Robust multimodal pretraining for heterogeneous and missing PSG on SleepFM
  encoders. Shared–private heads are an implementation tool; the claim is
  incomplete-montage robustness with honesty gates—not novel shared-private
  factorization.
keywords:
  - sleep
  - polysomnography
  - foundation model
  - multimodal
  - missing modalities
  - SleepFM
